2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context-
(a)
'Appointing Authority' means the Governor of Assam ;
(b)
'Board' means the Selection Board constituted under Rule 15 ;
(c)
'Commission' means the Assam Public Service Commission ;
(d)
'Government' means the Government of Assam ;
(e)
'Governor' means the Governor of Assam ;
(f)
'Member' means a member of the Assam Engineering (Irrigation Department) Service;
(g)
'Select list' means the list as referred to in Rule 6(1)(d) and the lists finally approved by the Appointing Authority under
Rule 13(6) and by the Commission under Rule 14(2);
(h)
'Service' means the Assam Engineering (Irrigation Department) Service; and
(i)
'Year' means a calendar year.
